n","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbcb80a62faf05ea\" href=\"?note=bbcb80a62faf05ea\" title=\"17-df-ultrapower\">17-df-ultrapower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-6.4.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L\">\\(\\equiv_L\\)</span> (elementary equivalence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L\\)</span> (ultrapower predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bbcb80a62faf05ea\" href=\"?note=bbcb80a62faf05ea\" title=\"17-df-ultrapower\">17-df-ultrapower</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (structure isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\,\\exists U\\,\\exists\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\,\\exists\\mathfrak B^\\ast\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak A^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak B,I,U,\\mathfrak B^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\cong\\mathfrak B^\\ast\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\,\\exists U\\,\\exists\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\,\\exists\\mathfrak B^\\ast\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak A^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak B,I,U,\\mathfrak B^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\cong\\mathfrak B^\\ast\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The same index set and the same ultrafilter are used for both ultrapowers. The theorem characterizes elementary equivalence, not isomorphism of the original structures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrapower]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ (class of $L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"